---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import DoubleBox from "../../components/DoubleBox.astro";
import BoxBanner from "../../components/BoxBanner.astro";
---

<Layout title="Aviso de Privacidad">
        <div class=" my-12 mx-auto max-w-[1080px]">
            <h1
                class="audiowide neon-verde text-center md:text-left pt-4 font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
            >
                Código de Ética y Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias
            </h1>
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row">
                <div class="sm:min-w-[calc(100%-400px)] lg:mr-10 roboto">
                <br>
<p>En cumplimiento de la legislación vigente, ponemos a disposición de nuestros radioescuchas los datos de contacto de los Defensores de las Audiencias designados por la Cámara Nacional de la Industria de Radio y Televisión (CIRT), quienes reciben y atienden quejas, observaciones y sugerencias relacionadas con nuestros contenidos y programación.</p>
<p>Lic. Eli Manuel Ramírez Villaseñor</p>
<div class="contact-email">
    <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com">defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com</a>
    <div class="mail-actions" aria-label="Escribir a defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com">
        <a
            class="mail-action gmail"
            href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=defensor1%40cirtcomunicacion.com&su=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Gmail</span>
        </a>
        <a
            class="mail-action outlook"
            href="https://outlook.office.com/mail/deeplink/compose?to=defensor1%40cirtcomunicacion.com&subject=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Outlook</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
<p>Lic. Fabiana Estrada Tena</p>
<div class="contact-email">
    <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com">defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com</a>
    <div class="mail-actions" aria-label="Escribir a defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com">
        <a
            class="mail-action gmail"
            href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=defensor2%40cirtcomunicacion.com&su=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Gmail</span>
        </a>
        <a
            class="mail-action outlook"
            href="https://outlook.office.com/mail/deeplink/compose?to=defensor2%40cirtcomunicacion.com&subject=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Outlook</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
<p>Domicilio: Av. Horacio 1013, Col. Polanco III Sección, Alcaldía Miguel Hidalgo, C.P. 11540, Ciudad de México.</p>
<p>Teléfono: 55 5726 9909</p>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<div class="download-list" aria-label="Documentos para descargar">
    <a class="download-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://storage.googleapis.com/nrm-web/nrm/CodigoEtica/CODIGO%20DE%20ETICA%202026%20AFILIADOS%20CIR%20T%20-%20RADIO%20PROYECCIO%CC%81N%20(XEOYE-FM).pdf">
        <span class="download-file-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="download-copy">
            <span class="download-title">Código de Ética</span>
            <span class="download-caption">Descargar PDF</span>
        </span>
        <span class="download-action" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5M12 15V3"/></svg>
        </span>
    </a>
    <a class="download-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://storage.googleapis.com/nrm-web/nrm/CodigoEtica/Lineamientos%20Generales%20para%20la%20Proteccio%CC%81n%20de%20los%20Derechos%20de%20las%20Audiencias.pdf">
        <span class="download-file-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="download-copy">
            <span class="download-title">Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias</span>
            <span class="download-caption">Descargar PDF</span>
        </span>
        <span class="download-action" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5M12 15V3"/></svg>
        </span>
    </a>
</div>
                </div>



            </div>
        </div>
</Layout>


<style>
a {
    color: #60A5FA;
}

.contact-email {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.contact-address {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.mail-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.mail-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #60A5FA;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #1e293b;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease;
}

.mail-action:hover {
    border-color: #3b82f6;
    background: #eff6ff;
}

.mail-action:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #2563eb;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

.download-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
}

.download-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 5rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.125rem;
    border: 1px solid #d8dce2;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #202124;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, background-color 150ms ease;
}

.download-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--red-color);
    background: #fffafa;
}

.download-item:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--red-color);
    outline-offset: 3px;
}

.download-file-icon {
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 3rem;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: var(--red-color);
    color: #fff;
}

.download-file-icon svg {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
}

.download-copy {
    display: grid;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
}

.download-title {
    color: #202124;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
}

.download-caption {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--red-color);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.download-action {
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 2.5rem;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid #cbd0d7;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #202124;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, color 150ms ease;
}

.download-action svg {
    width: 1.125rem;
    height: 1.125rem;
}

.download-item:hover .download-action {
    border-color: var(--red-color);
    color: var(--red-color);
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    .download-item {
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.75rem;
    }

    .download-title {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
}

</style>